        },
        "quote": "(a) Allowable Districts for Wind Energy Systems. Wind energy systems are allowed in all nonresidential districts and in residential districts with nonresidential uses. There is no minimum acreage requirement.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
