          "end": 221,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:1",
          "start": 209
        },
        "quote": "(b) Setback.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "c1148343-b22f-57a1-9150-6d47707c9231",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 259,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:2",
          "start": 222
        },
        "quote": "(1) Setback standards are as follows:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "129631fd-958f-5e7b-9c5b-e6531d78e95f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 300,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:3",
          "start": 260
        },
        "quote": "(i) One hundred percent of tower height.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "bf1fb2b2-ce02-5a50-9d8f-33421f8d7c1b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 427,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:4",
          "start": 301
        },
        "quote": "(ii) One hundred percent of any combination of setback and dedicated irrevocable fall zone easement onto an adjacent property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "3a215e48-df48-5ace-909c-2c071124b2bb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 463,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:5",
          "start": 428
        },
        "quote": "(2) Additional Setback Regulations.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "5336b03f-1533-551d-853b-7676a57c879d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 568,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:6",
          "start": 464
        },
        "quote": "(i) No wind energy system shall be placed within any required zoning setback within any zoning district.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "36813c1a-cb31-5c3b-bdc0-e6b6e9659d2d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 768,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:7",
          "start": 569
        },
        "quote": "(ii) No horizontal axis wind turbine (HAWT) tower shall be placed on any property such that any portion of the rotor diameter extends into or over a public right-of-way, or dedicated access easement.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "6b1e50b2-8083-54c4-aa88-8458232b692e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1269,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:8",
          "start": 769
        },
        "quote": "(3) Exceptions to Setback Requirements. All wind systems specifically designed to be mounted to a permanent building must comply with all manufacturer specifications; provided, that any portion of a tower above the point at which it is anchored does not exceed the distance to the nearest adjacent property line. All mounting and electrical specifications must be provided to the Development Services Division at the time of application for a building permit to install or erect a wind energy system.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "b278f893-471d-5e42-8ed7-f28c0eb87ab4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1295,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:9",
          "start": 1270
        },
        "quote": "(c) Maximum Tower Height.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
