          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:18",
          "start": 1498
        },
        "quote": "(2) Exceptions.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "79abcf48-3c66-5ea0-866a-9a2cfb883e00",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1735,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:19",
          "start": 1514
        },
        "quote": "(i) The maximum height of all wind energy systems mounted on a permanent building will be determined in association with the approval of a conditional use permit within C-5 Commercial and D-1, D-2, D-3 Downtown Districts.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "2dd6d234-82e1-5ac1-84c9-6441e828059e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1968,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:20",
          "start": 1736
        },
        "quote": "(ii) The maximum height of all wind energy systems will be determined in association with the approval of a conditional use permit within the I-1 and I-2 districts, as well as PUD districts with permitted uses designated I-1 or I-2.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "1a423021-544c-591d-aa89-f761c942b5da",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2095,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:21",
          "start": 1969
        },
        "quote": "(d) Rotor Diameter. Maximum rotor diameter shall not exceed manufacturer recommendations for wattage and tower specifications.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "a5ddb460-acb2-5703-8235-af5d18b66c38",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2352,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:22",
          "start": 2096
        },
        "quote": "(e) Towers. All wind energy systems shall be mounted on monopole towers or attached to a permanent building. No lattice or guy-wired towers shall be permitted except in districts zoned industrial and PUD districts with permitted uses designated I-1 or I-2.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 23",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 23,
          "component_id": "fc967c57-c810-5bbb-b642-aba8f8792178",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2364,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:23",
          "start": 2353
        },
        "quote": "(f) Access.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:23#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 24",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 24,
          "component_id": "eadd530f-9ac5-5122-88e9-924bf0932275",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2481,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:24",
          "start": 2365
        },
        "quote": "(1) All ground-mounted electrical and control equipment shall be labeled and secured to prevent unauthorized access.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:24#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 25",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 25,
          "component_id": "0e2c0b91-2f2c-5337-a27e-0df9fcfd27ed",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2657,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:25",
          "start": 2482
        },
        "quote": "(2) The tower shall be designed and installed so as to not provide step bolts or a ladder readily accessible to the public for a minimum height of eight feet above the ground.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:25#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 26",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 26,
          "component_id": "5640201b-ab34-5633-b006-53d18cf1d4d8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2796,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:26",
          "start": 2658
        },
        "quote": "(g) Electrical Wires. All electrical wires associated with wind energy systems shall be located underground with the following exceptions:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:26#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 27",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 27,
          "component_id": "ae8476ca-72f2-5d04-966b-6f292aae9e02",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2871,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:27",
          "start": 2797
        },
        "quote": "(1) All wires necessary to connect the wind generator to the tower wiring.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:27#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 28",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 28,
          "component_id": "66bfa9b9-7a89-540a-b147-265e1db300ed",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2955,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:28",
          "start": 2872
        },
        "quote": "(2) All wires necessary to connect the tower wiring to the disconnect junction box.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:28#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.265.030 block 29",
        "locator": {
